*                        Flags in CCW+5:                                02460000
D58FMORE EQU   X'80'     -- Enable MORE before displaying data          02470000
D58FLNO  EQU   X'3F'     -- Starting line number mask                   02480000
D58FERAS EQU   X'FF'     -- Just clear screen. No new data              02490000
D58FGOCP EQU   X'FE'     -- Present a cleared CP screen                 02500000
         SPACE 1                                                        02510000
D58FSWT  EQU   X'29'     Full-Screen Write                              02520000
D58FSRD  EQU   X'2A'     Full-Screen Read                               02530000
         SPACE 1                                                        02540000
*                        Flags in CCW+5:                                02550000
D58FEW   EQU   X'80'     -- Erase/Write                                 02560000
D58FEWA  EQU   X'C0'     -- Erase/Write Alternate                       02570000
D58FWSF  EQU   X'20'     -- Write Structured Field                      02580000
D58FPA1  EQU   X'10'     -- Reflect PA1 to virtual machine              02590000
D58FRM   EQU   X'80'     -- Read Modified                               02600000
